// exchange-chaos-tool is the Phase-04.5 Task 4.5.3.1 chaos-suite helper.
// It lives OUTSIDE services/ (same trick as tests/soak) so harness deps never
// pollute the service module; the `replace` below resolves the service
// module, and the exchange/ module-path prefix satisfies Go's internal-
// visibility rule for exchange/internal/... imports.
module exchange/tests/chaos

